  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14108829",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-131338",
      "knowledge_point_id": "3ad4e453-00da-5c77-8d6a-5de4dc3d5593",
      "knowledge_point": "Calculating the Curl of a Vector Field",
      "problem": "Given that $F(x,y,z)=x\\,i+2y\\,j+3z\\,k,$ what is $\\text{curl}\\,F?$",
      "worked_solution": "If $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j+R\\,k$ is a vector field on ${R}^{3}$ and the partial derivatives of the components of $F$ all exist, then the curl of $F$ is the vector field given by\n\n$$\ncurl\\,F=∇\\times F=|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂x} & \\frac{∂}{∂y} & \\frac{∂}{∂z} \\\\ P & Q & R\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{curl}\\,F & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂x} & \\frac{∂}{∂y} & \\frac{∂}{∂z} \\\\ x & 2y & 3z\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =[\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3z)-\\frac{∂}{∂z}(2y)]i-[\\frac{∂}{∂x}(3z)-\\frac{∂}{∂z}(x)]j+[\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2y)-\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x)]k \\\\  & =(0-0)\\,i-(0-0)\\,j+(0-0)\\,k \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "i+2\\,j+3\\,k",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "0",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "-i+2\\,j-3\\,k",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "-3y\\,i+2x\\,j-z\\,k",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "3\\,j-2\\,k",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source_answer_policy": {
        "version": "revealed-ma-answer-v1",
        "feedback_sha256": "c8afd7be7720a8d802ddf4d8234242603f5a8c1cba5e9a610fd34a06544d7b15"
      },
      "difficulty": "easy",
